{"slug":"Zombie-Attack-Fresh-Script-33919","_id":"67ed8dc1119f3145795cb207","title":"Fresh Script","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78146","gameId":1240123653,"name":"Zombie Attack","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":1240123653},"features":"!! PLEASE READ !!\nAbout executor :\nWhen I created this script, I used Delta, so the executor I highly recommend for mobile users is Delta. As for other executors, I tried to keep the script as minimal as possible. If any executor cannot run my script, it doesn't mean there is a problem with my script.\n\nIf you don't have money to buy Wave or AWP.GG, I recommend using Delta or executor with high unc.\nExecutor for mobile users that I recommend: Delta, Arceus x, Codex, Krnl\nExecutor for users on the computer that I recommend Wave, AWP.GG, or executors with high unc\n\nAbout skid :\nMy script was not skidded from anyone else's script; I created this script using my own skills and knowledge. I am willing to let you compare my script with others to see how my script differs from theirs and why I am so confident in the performance and stability of my own script.\n\n--\nHello, this is Fresh's Script, formerly known as Flores's Script.\nSince the last time I uploaded my script, it's been 3 years. Now I'm about to upload a new script of my own, but it's a zombie attack game because I'm bored and have nothing to do, and I'm too lazy to write a script for a bigger game.\nBut then what? I have learned to make my own script have good performance.\n\nHow is my zombie attack script different from others?\nThis script primarily focuses on performance. This means that your phone or computer might not lag at all while using my script in the long term.\nAnd I wrote this script to minimize bugs as much as possible. Maybe you can use my script overnight without encountering any bugs or lag (I'm not sure because I 